{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5:u000001"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "into buy when you buy a property you pay four percent to register it. In Saudi, you pay five percent. And if you are a foreign buyer in insider approved homes, you may pay another two percent on top.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5:u000001"}], "text": "In Dubai, when you buy a property, you pay four percent to register it, whereas, in Saudi Arabia, you pay five percent. Foreign buyers in insider-approved homes in Saudi Arabia may pay an additional two percent."}, "title": "Real estate registration fees", "topic": "real_estate_finance"}, "content_hash": "374e8d0c646755a087e83e394fa0c83ede64382457aa657fd015dc544b411604", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5:knowledge:2a309c60eabe38d2", "metadata_hash": "04c3c1f750c2420c829b88154606b7c3813192b1731e19376912967e712ca610", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-08-20", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "e5116a4c59f7a4f51e9bb0772bdc48f8559cd1391d340e79a1e2d97778f6477d", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tp38mbd6Q6g", "title": "Real estate registration fees", "topic": "real_estate_finance", "topic_slug": "real_estate_finance"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5:u000001"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "self_report", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "And yet, right now international investors are booking flights to Riyadh. They're asking about Jeddah, the Red Sea, and increasingly about Medina, where for the first time, eligible foreign buyers can register ownership inside their haram.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5:u000001"}], "text": "International investors are showing interest in Saudi cities like Riyadh, Jeddah, the Red Sea, and increasingly Medina due to new opportunities for foreign ownership."}, "title": "International investor interest in Saudi Arabia", "topic": "investment_interest"}, "content_hash": "374e8d0c646755a087e83e394fa0c83ede64382457aa657fd015dc544b411604", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5:knowledge:60b6f7ff069537ab", "metadata_hash": "04c3c1f750c2420c829b88154606b7c3813192b1731e19376912967e712ca610", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-08-20", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "e5116a4c59f7a4f51e9bb0772bdc48f8559cd1391d340e79a1e2d97778f6477d", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tp38mbd6Q6g", "title": "International investor interest in Saudi Arabia", "topic": "investment_interest", "topic_slug": "investment_interest"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5:u000003"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "Saudi Arabia is now offering foreign investors something that they never offered before. Not a vision, not a rendering, a legal road to own. New zones open to foreign ownership and Riyadh preparing for Expo 2030.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5:u000003"}], "text": "Saudi Arabia is now offering legal pathways for foreign investors to own property, with new zones open to foreign ownership and development aimed at Expo 2030."}, "title": "Legal changes for foreign investors in Saudi Arabia", "topic": "foreign_investment_law"}, "content_hash": "374e8d0c646755a087e83e394fa0c83ede64382457aa657fd015dc544b411604", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5:knowledge:8219d30816e03c2e", "metadata_hash": "04c3c1f750c2420c829b88154606b7c3813192b1731e19376912967e712ca610", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-08-20", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "e5116a4c59f7a4f51e9bb0772bdc48f8559cd1391d340e79a1e2d97778f6477d", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tp38mbd6Q6g", "title": "Legal changes for foreign investors in Saudi Arabia", "topic": "foreign_investment_law", "topic_slug": "foreign_investment_law"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5:u000004"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "self_report", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "I worked in Dubai for over twelve years. Me and my team is responsible for more than one billion in sales volume. For the past six years, I'm coaching agents how to do the same, not only in US.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5:u000004"}], "text": "The speaker has twelve years of experience working in Dubai's real estate market and has been coaching agents for the past six years in the US, Saudi Arabia, and Bahrain."}, "title": "Personal experience in Dubai real estate coaching", "topic": "real_estate_expertise"}, "content_hash": "374e8d0c646755a087e83e394fa0c83ede64382457aa657fd015dc544b411604", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5:knowledge:139e8ad7d3143f3c", "metadata_hash": "04c3c1f750c2420c829b88154606b7c3813192b1731e19376912967e712ca610", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-08-20", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "e5116a4c59f7a4f51e9bb0772bdc48f8559cd1391d340e79a1e2d97778f6477d", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tp38mbd6Q6g", "title": "Personal experience in Dubai real estate coaching", "topic": "real_estate_expertise", "topic_slug": "real_estate_expertise"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5:u000005"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "Those two things are not always the same. And that gap is where investors lose money.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5:u000005"}], "text": "There is often a gap between understanding Saudi real estate market announcements and the realities of actual transactions, where investors may lose money."}, "title": "Challenges in Saudi real estate for foreign investors", "topic": "real_estate_challenges"}, "content_hash": "374e8d0c646755a087e83e394fa0c83ede64382457aa657fd015dc544b411604", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5:knowledge:4807de30920fee17", "metadata_hash": "04c3c1f750c2420c829b88154606b7c3813192b1731e19376912967e712ca610", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-08-20", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "e5116a4c59f7a4f51e9bb0772bdc48f8559cd1391d340e79a1e2d97778f6477d", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tp38mbd6Q6g", "title": "Challenges in Saudi real estate for foreign investors", "topic": "real_estate_challenges", "topic_slug": "real_estate_challenges"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5:u000013", "youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5:u000014"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "Saudi Arabia is a huge country. It's thirty seven point six million. Medium ages under thirty, roughly sixty three percent under thirty five.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5:u000013"}], "text": "About 63% of Saudi Arabia's population is under the age of 35."}, "title": "Saudi Arabia's age demographics", "topic": "demographics"}, "content_hash": "374e8d0c646755a087e83e394fa0c83ede64382457aa657fd015dc544b411604", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5:knowledge:25bde8f91ec802a9", "metadata_hash": "04c3c1f750c2420c829b88154606b7c3813192b1731e19376912967e712ca610", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-08-20", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "e5116a4c59f7a4f51e9bb0772bdc48f8559cd1391d340e79a1e2d97778f6477d", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tp38mbd6Q6g", "title": "Saudi Arabia's age demographics", "topic": "demographics", "topic_slug": "demographics"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5:u000018", "youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5:u000019"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "for the first time, eligible foreign Muslim can access registered property ownership in approved areas of the city.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5:u000018"}, {"quote": "Now, in approved zones, eligible buyers can own property that can be used by the family, rented, resold, or passed to the next generation.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5:u000019"}], "text": "In Medina, for the first time, eligible foreign Muslims can access registered property ownership in approved areas, allowing them to own, rent, resell, or pass down properties to the next generation."}, "title": "Medina's property market changes", "topic": "medina_real_estate"}, "content_hash": "374e8d0c646755a087e83e394fa0c83ede64382457aa657fd015dc544b411604", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5:knowledge:abc72603bc573acb", "metadata_hash": "04c3c1f750c2420c829b88154606b7c3813192b1731e19376912967e712ca610", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-08-20", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "e5116a4c59f7a4f51e9bb0772bdc48f8559cd1391d340e79a1e2d97778f6477d", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tp38mbd6Q6g", "title": "Medina's property market changes", "topic": "medina_real_estate", "topic_slug": "medina_real_estate"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5:u000011", "youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5:u000012"], "form": "structure", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "Riyadh won Expo twenty thirteen October twenty twenty three, which puts Riyadh today roughly where Dubai I was in 2016.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5:u000011"}, {"quote": "But the mechanism of global event forcing the global infrastructure development, the single it's what had happened in Dubai.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5:u000012"}], "text": "The speaker draws a parallel between Riyadh's current market situation and Dubai's past experience with Expo 2020, suggesting similar potential for growth and development."}, "purpose": null, "speaker_id": "1", "title": "Parallel drawn between Riyadh and Dubai", "topic": "market_comparison"}, "content_hash": "374e8d0c646755a087e83e394fa0c83ede64382457aa657fd015dc544b411604", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5:expression:422056dc675e0b29", "metadata_hash": "04c3c1f750c2420c829b88154606b7c3813192b1731e19376912967e712ca610", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2026-08-20", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "e5116a4c59f7a4f51e9bb0772bdc48f8559cd1391d340e79a1e2d97778f6477d", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tp38mbd6Q6g", "title": "Parallel drawn between Riyadh and Dubai", "topic": "market_comparison", "topic_slug": "market_comparison"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5:u000026", "youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5:u000027"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "advice", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "nobody knows. I can read regulations, I can see the transactions, when my colleagues actually in Riyadh are processing, I can compare that to say I'll leave through personally here in Dubai, but I cannot predict the future.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5:u000027"}], "text": "The speaker advises against making definite predictions about the real estate market, stating \"nobody knows\" and whatever is discussed is based on current opinions and might change as the market evolves."}, "title": "Real estate market prediction disclaimer", "topic": "real estate investment"}, "content_hash": "374e8d0c646755a087e83e394fa0c83ede64382457aa657fd015dc544b411604", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5:knowledge:4a53e4e189c42633", "metadata_hash": "04c3c1f750c2420c829b88154606b7c3813192b1731e19376912967e712ca610", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-08-20", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "e5116a4c59f7a4f51e9bb0772bdc48f8559cd1391d340e79a1e2d97778f6477d", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tp38mbd6Q6g", "title": "Real estate market prediction disclaimer", "topic": "real estate investment", "topic_slug": "real-estate-investment"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5:u000028"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "Being legally allowed to buy is not the same as allowed to sell or even able to sell easily.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5:u000028"}], "text": "Being legally allowed to buy a property is not the same as being able to sell it easily."}, "title": "Liquidity concerns in property investment", "topic": "real estate investment"}, "content_hash": "374e8d0c646755a087e83e394fa0c83ede64382457aa657fd015dc544b411604", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5:knowledge:b2e44c721137b087", "metadata_hash": "04c3c1f750c2420c829b88154606b7c3813192b1731e19376912967e712ca610", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-08-20", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "e5116a4c59f7a4f51e9bb0772bdc48f8559cd1391d340e79a1e2d97778f6477d", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tp38mbd6Q6g", "title": "Liquidity concerns in property investment", "topic": "real estate investment", "topic_slug": "real-estate-investment"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5:u000028", "youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5:u000029", "youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5:u000030"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "Saudi Arabia has almost no public transaction history for the um international on property, that's not a criticism. It's what an early stage market looks like. Dubai looked exactly like this once, two thousand five.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5:u000028"}], "text": "In early-stage markets like Saudi Arabia, there may not be sufficient public transaction history, reflecting what Dubai looked like in 2005."}, "title": "Investment in early-stage markets", "topic": "real estate investment"}, "content_hash": "374e8d0c646755a087e83e394fa0c83ede64382457aa657fd015dc544b411604", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5:knowledge:678d180a75e1ad96", "metadata_hash": "04c3c1f750c2420c829b88154606b7c3813192b1731e19376912967e712ca610", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-08-20", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "e5116a4c59f7a4f51e9bb0772bdc48f8559cd1391d340e79a1e2d97778f6477d", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-20-dubai-vs-saudi-real-estate-foreign-ownership-expo-2030-the-n-48ff0090d5", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tp38mbd6Q6g", "title": "Investment in early-stage markets", "topic": "real estate investment", "topic_slug": "real-estate-investment"}
